# ECSESS Project Rules

Read `AGENTS.md` for full context. Key points:

- Bun + SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5 runes + Tailwind v4
- Shared UI: `$lib/components/` — page UI: `src/routes/{route}/components/`
- Sanity via `getFromCMS()` in `+page.server.ts` only; types in `$lib/schemas.ts`
- Use `ecsess-*` Tailwind tokens from `src/app.css`, not raw hex colors
- Every page: `SeoMetaTags` + `Section` gradient wrappers
- Minimize diff scope; match existing code style
